  "Description__c": "Every job and every crew on one App page. The Gantt shows each job with its phases and the trades waiting on each other; the Timeline shows each crew's next two weeks across all jobs. A crew is an MDP Resource with a Capacity of 1, so a drag that would put it on two jobs on the same day is refused and names what that crew is already on. Office Closure records are days nobody works (with a resource, that crew's day off), and a push skips them like weekends."
